  "longBusinessSummary": "XPS Pensions Group plc, together with its subsidiaries, provides consulting and administration services related to UK pension schemes and insurers in the United Kingdom. It offers convent and pension advisory; investment and insurance consulting; DB master trust schemes; and self-invested personal pension and SSAS pension services. The company also provides pension administration services, such as scheme administration, outsourcing, payroll, scheme accounting, communications, and scam identification and protection, as well as de-risking projects, GMP equalization, data audits and cleansing, and trustee secretarial services. In addition, it provides XPS Arena, a digital learning platform; trustee and governance services; and technology and trackers. Further, the company offers employee benefit consultancy and related business services; and involved in the management consultancy activities. The company was formerly known as Xafinity Plc and changed its name to XPS Pensions Group Plc in May 2018. XPS Pensions Group plc was incorporated in 2012 and is based in Reading, the United Kingdom.",
